  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Manage Google Calendar events from Camunda-based processes",
    "splashDescription": "Managing calendar events by hand across multiple systems is time-consuming and error-prone. The Google Calendar connector lets you create, update, and delete events directly from a Camunda-based business process, including complex recurring events and their individual occurrences. Teams can keep calendars in sync automatically and eliminate manual data entry as part of their broader process automation.",
